  "notable_quotes": [
    "The superior anti-Microcystis performance was not general to all Zn-MAFs; inhibition varied across Zn-Hmtz, Zn-Mhtz, and Zn-Tz depending on ligand structure.",
    "Fine-tuning methyl substitution on triazole ligands produced three structurally different Zn-MAFs, and these methyl-group differences changed algal removal performance.",
    "Zn-Tz showed significantly enhanced inhibition of Microcystis aeruginosa and delivered the highest inhibitory effect per unit cost among the tested Zn-MAFs."
